\begin{remark}[Deformations of complex tori]\label{rem:V:tori-deformations-input}
The stability of complex tori under deformation in the large is
established in \cite[definition, p.~261; Theorem 2.1, p.~264]{Catanese2004}.
The relative-form calculation below writes the torus quotient
on the regular analytic open set used in the boundary argument.
\end{remark}
